Decide row 7's ceiling and rows 22 to 26 of docs/RUST-PORT.md §5 (from review 9) and record the decisions in §10. Each row names a recommended choice:
- 7, nesting: CPython reads 994 levels on 3.11, about 10,000 on 3.12/3.13 and 116,199 on 3.14 (this Mac, C-stack bound), and replay has no depth check. Recommended: one fixed ceiling (10,000 proposed) in both, Python checking depth before json.loads;
